Privacy Policy for Timetables

This application has no internal tracking tools or any other data collection systems. It does use
APIs and external services from RFI (Rete Ferroviaria Italiana) and Trenitalia, but does not store
cookies or any other 3rd party data that might help with tracking. Please refer to the privacy
policies of these external services to learn more about their policies:
- https://www.trenitalia.com/it/informazioni/termini-e-condizioni-di-utilizzo-sito-trenitalia.html
- https://www.trenitalia.com/it/informazioni/protezione-dei-dati-personali.html
- https://www.rfi.it/it/misc/termini-e-condizioni.html
- https://www.rfi.it/it/misc/protezione-dati.html

This app offers no warranties, please refer to the license to learn more:
